    {
      "id": "claim_2c577a20f41241ad968874a03e60f7d3",
      "statement": "Reservation requests are idempotent: replaying the exact same request returns the cached result without decrementing stock again. The service detects replays using a SHA-256 fingerprint of the canonicalized item list. Replaying a released reservation returns 409.",
