      "statement": "Tests are split into two layers: main_test.go contains fast unit tests validating input rules and fingerprint behavior without a database; integration_test.go contains PostgreSQL-backed tests verifying concurrent reservations cannot oversell, exact replays succeed, conflicting replays fail, and double-release is idempotent. The Docker build runs go test ./... before producing the final binary.",
